This repository does not include third-party source trees. It builds on the following projects:

- IF-Prune (https://github.com/snap-research/EVLM-IF-Prune), Apache License 2.0. setup.sh clones it at commit
  d17c2af; models/ runs PRUDENT on its InternVL wrapper.
- lmms-eval (https://github.com/EvolvingLMMs-Lab/lmms-eval), MIT License, in the copy that IF-Prune ships.
  patches/lmms-eval.patch holds our changes to that copy, and tasks/ adds task files written in its format.
- The selection functions in baselines/ (and their copies in families/fam_opp.py) re-implement VisionZip, ToMe,
  CDPruner, MMTok and ZOO-Prune for InternVL and Qwen3-VL, following each paper and the official code named in
  the docstrings of baselines/fuse_vz.py and baselines/fuse_new.py. They are not copies of that code.
- families/probe_q3.py copies the dynamic_preprocess tiling of InternVL (https://github.com/OpenGVLab/InternVL),
  MIT License.

Model weights and benchmark data are not part of this repository and keep their own licenses. data/prompts holds
the prompts built from the benchmarks' questions, and data/perq the answers of the models to them.
